#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:32 5950aad946694d238a09502e0c8eea1a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get eQTL associations (variant-gene expression "
"correlations) from a specific dataset in the EBI eQTL Catalogue. Returns "
"statistical associations between genetic variants and molecular traits "
"(gene/exon/transcript expression or splicing). Each result includes beta "
"effect size, p-value, allele frequency, and variant coordinates. Use "
"eQTL\\_list\\_datasets first to find available dataset IDs. Can filter by"
" gene\\_id (Ensembl gene ID) or variant (chr\\_pos\\_ref\\_alt format)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:77
#: 6c3ee3d60c3e49ccae6bb804df70972c ca3ac85de19d49bcb3118e43e2cbbc8e
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:36 24df83d7d3174c7bbbf8efa19d93360c
msgid ""
"``dataset_id`` (string) (required) Dataset identifier from "
"eQTL\\_list\\_datasets (e.g., 'QTD000001', 'QTD000584')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:39 e41f210b89b646759f4c4e93955e0811
msgid ""
"``size`` (integer) (optional) Number of associations to return (default "
"20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:42 3b8a19526a3f4147a66c153b6f72acad
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by Ensembl gene ID (e.g., "
"'ENSG00000141510' for TP53). Returns all eQTLs affecting this gene."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:45 b985133e90f04905ac60581f7fe8bf9c
msgid ""
"``variant`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by variant in "
"chr\\_pos\\_ref\\_alt format (e.g., 'chr1\\_791100\\_G\\_GGGA'). Returns "
"all genes affected by this variant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eqtl_tools.rst:48 0acb8c4999eb4116a6ad512f04e89a73
msgid ""
"``molecular_trait_id`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by molecular "
"trait ID (usually same as gene\\_id for 'ge' datasets)"
msgstr ""

